简单前端示例（展示透明价格与费用分解）
- 下面这个 HTML/JavaScript 片段会在商品页或购物车页同时显示“广告价”和“预计总价（含费用）”，并列出费用明细，帮助降低因隐藏费用导致的放弃购物车。

```html
<div id="price-box">
  <div>广告价: <span id="base-price">$99.00</span></div>
  <div>费用明细:</div>
  <ul id="fees-list"></ul>
  <div><strong>预计总价（含以上费用）: <span id="total-price"></span></strong></div>
  <div style="font-size:0.9em; color:#666;">注：以上为预计总价，最终以结账页面为准。</div>
</div>

<script>
  const basePrice = 99.00;
  const fees = [
    { name: '处理费', amount: 50.00 },
    { name: '服务费', amount: 50.00 },
    { name: '便利费', amount: 50.00 }
  ];

  document.getElementById('base-price').textContent = `$${basePrice.toFixed(2)}`;

  const feesList = document.getElementById('fees-list');
  let total = basePrice;
  fees.forEach(f => {
    const li = document.createElement('li');
    li.textContent = `${f.name}: $${f.amount.toFixed(2)}`;
    feesList.appendChild(li);
    total += f.amount;
  });

  document.getElementById('total-price').textContent = `$${total.toFixed(2)}`;
</script>
```

